<h2 id="ranking">The craft ranking (201 cards real decks run)</h2>

<p class="sub"><strong>How to read each column.</strong> <em>Rank</em> is the sort position. <em>Card</em> is the card name (bold = you don't own a playset yet). <em>CI</em> is "color identity", which colors the card uses; "C" means colorless (any deck can use it). <em>Rarity</em> tells you which wildcard pile to spend from. <em>Set</em> is the 3-letter code of the expansion the card is in. <em>Type</em> is creature, artifact, land, etc. <em>MV</em> is mana value (what it costs to play). <em>Owned</em> is how many copies you currently have on Arena. <em>WC to 4-of</em> is how many wildcards it would cost to finish a playset. <em>Decks that run it</em> is the headline number: if you craft this card, how many of the 55 published Mardu-color Standard decklists in this project's harvest actually run it. The counts are read from the lists themselves and range from 2 to 18 across these rows, topping out at Godless Shrine on 18. The source is the creator-video harvest described in the Method note, not Untapped's own per-deck lists, which this project has not decoded. Quantity does not matter, one copy or four, the question is only whether each deck plays the card. A higher number means crafting it helps more of your decks, so each wildcard does more work. Every row here is run by at least 2 of the 55, which is the threshold for appearing in the table at all. Each row now carries a <strong>Decks</strong> button next to that count. It opens the actual lists behind the number: which harvested decks run the card, who built each one, how many copies its list runs, what the whole deck costs in rare and mythic wildcards, and a link to the video the list came from. The button reads the same pool the count was measured from, so the list it opens always has exactly as many decks as the number beside it. Switch to <strong>All Standard decks</strong> above and the buttons re-scope to that pool.</p>

<div class="rkctl" id="rk-ctl"><span class="rklab">Deck pool</span><button class="rkbtn on" id="rk-m" onclick="rkPool('m')">Mardu wedge only <b>57</b></button><button class="rkbtn" id="rk-a" onclick="rkPool('a')">All Standard decks <b>230</b></button><span class="rkhint" id="rk-hint">Scored against the 57 real white/black/red Standard decklists in <code>creator-winrate-db/deck_costs.json</code>.</span></div><style>.rkctl{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0 0 14px;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #d9c9a6;border-radius:8px;background:#FFF7E6}.rklab{font:700 10px/1 ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6250}.rkbtn{font:600 12px/1 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;border:1.5px solid #b9ab8e;background:#fff;color:#6b6250;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 13px;cursor:pointer}.rkbtn.on{background:#5B8C8A;border-color:#5B8C8A;color:#fff}.rkhint{font-size:12px;color:#7c7059;flex:1 1 240px;min-width:200px}a.rk-buy{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1.5px solid #5B8C8A;padding-bottom:1px;white-space:nowrap}a.rk-buy:hover{color:#2f5e5c;border-bottom-color:#2f5e5c}a.rk-buy::after{content:"\00a0\1F6D2";font-size:.8em;opacity:0}a.rk-buy:hover::after{opacity:.75}.usd-na{color:#9a8f7a}a.rk-src{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px dotted #c3b394}a.rk-src:hover{color:#5B8C8A;border-bottom-color:#5B8C8A}</style><script>function rkPool(p){document.querySelectorAll("tbody.rk-m").forEach(function(e){e.hidden=(p!=="m");});document.querySelectorAll("tbody.rk-a").forEach(function(e){e.hidden=(p!=="a");});document.getElementById("rk-m").classList.toggle("on",p==="m");document.getElementById("rk-a").classList.toggle("on",p==="a");document.getElementById("rk-hint").textContent = (p==="m")? "Scored against the 57 real white/black/red Standard decklists in deck_costs.json.": "Scored against all 230 real Standard decklists in deck_costs.json, every color.";}</script><table id="ranking-table">
  <thead>
    <tr>
